   "text": {
    "L1": "Yoga is an ancient Indian practice for health and well-being.",
    "L2": "The word yoga comes from the Sanskrit root yuj, meaning to join or unite.",
    "L3": "Yoga joins the mind with the body through attention and asanas.",
    "L4": "If the mind wanders, the activity is only stretching, not yoga.",
    "L5": "Asanas can make muscles stronger and more flexible, and may reduce body pain.",
    "L6": "Breathing techniques and meditation calm the mind and reduce stress.",
    "L7": "Yoga can also support better sleep, concentration and heart health.",
    "L8": "So the main idea is that yoga helps both body and mind. Choose that idea now."
   },
